/Title (Refer to the Material Safety Data Sheet \(MSDS\) for detailed handling instructions. Store the product in a cool, well-ventilated area away from heat, sparks, and open flames. Use protective equipment such as gloves, safety goggles, and masks during application. Avoid contact with eyes and skin; in case of contact, wash immediately with soap and plenty of water. In case of inhalation, move to fresh air and seek medical attention if discomfort persists. This product contains no added Lead, Mercury, or Chromium compounds and is flammable. Dispose of leftover paint and containers responsibly through authorized waste management agencies.)
